      "semantic_role": "section_heading",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0649",
      "reading_order": 685,
      "section": "CRANKCASE BREATHER",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.9386,
        "t": 718.5436068359375,
        "r": 564.7535999999999,
        "b": 683.3434492035387
      },
      "content": "Clean  the  crankcase  breather  element  at  the scheduled intervals, using the following procedure (see Figure 8-7).",
      "hyperlink_hint": true,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_684",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_684",
          "title": "CRANKCASE BREATHER"
        }
      ],
      "page": 55,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0650",
      "reading_order": 686,
      "section": "CRANKCASE BREATHER",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 325.2473,
        "t": 670.5253068359375,
        "r": 564.8537000000001,
        "b": 635.2679492035387
      },
      "content": "Remove the cap nuts and gaskets from the top of the cylinder head cover.  Carefully remove the cover.  Avoid damaging the gasket.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_684",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_684",
          "title": "CRANKCASE BREATHER"
        }
      ],
      "page": 55,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0651",
      "reading_order": 687,
      "section": "CRANKCASE BREATHER",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 325.2473,
        "t": 622.5059068359375,
        "r": 564.7535999999997,
        "b": 587.2485492035388
      },
      "content": "From  inside  the  cover,  remove  two  machine screws securing the breather element, plates and shield.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_684",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_684",
          "title": "CRANKCASE BREATHER"
        }
      ],
      "page": 55,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0652",
      "reading_order": 688,
      "section": "CRANKCASE BREATHER",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 325.2473,
        "t": 574.4304068359376,
        "r": 564.9405999999998,
        "b": 539.2302492035388
      },
      "content": "Clean the element in a suitable solvent.  Dry the element, then saturate with engine oil before replacing.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_684",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_684",
          "title": "CRANKCASE BREATHER"
        }
      ],
      "page": 55,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0653",
      "reading_order": 689,
      "section": "CRANKCASE BREATHER",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 339.6475,
        "t": 525.3342068359375,
        "r": 564.8560000000003,
        "b": 477.4896519502827
      },
      "content": "WARNING Many cleaning solvents present a hazard of severe personal injury or death. Follow the manufacturer's instructions and proceed with care.",
      "severity": "warning",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_684",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_684",
          "title": "CRANKCASE BREATHER"
        }
      ],
      "page": 55,
      "chunk_hint": "admonition",
      "semantic_role": "warning",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0654",
      "reading_order": 690,
      "section": "CRANKCASE BREATHER",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 325.24739999999997,
        "t": 464.67360683593756,
        "r": 564.7845000000003,
        "b": 442.0585492035388
      },
      "content": "If necessary, clean other breather components in solvent before reassembling.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_684",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
